// Master calendar & performance tuning — Qlik Sense Data Architect (QSDA 2024)
// Goal: Add a gap-free calendar and optimize memory/reload.
// Concepts: Master calendar generation, Cardinality reduction (split datetime), AutoNumber keys, Optimized QVD loads, Precomputed flags
// Qlik load script starter. Adapt connections/paths to your environment.

Policies:
LOAD
    PolicyID,
    Region,
    Product,
    WrittenPremium,
    IncurredLoss,
    Date(PolicyDate) as PolicyDate
FROM [lib://data/policies.qvd] (qvd);

